Package: crown
Title: Cluster-Randomized Trial Analysis with Outcomes Weighted for Nonresponse
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Brian", "Richardson", email = "richabr@wfu.edu", role = "aut"),
    person("zhitanhe", email = "zhitanhe@unc.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Estimates population mean potential outcomes and population-average
    causal effects using trial and auxiliary data. Provides parametric G-formula,
    inverse probability weighting, augmented inverse probability weighting, and
    Proposed cross-fitted nonparametric estimation with XGBoost nuisance models.
